event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":85,"item_id":"rs_019b8838198d3241016acd32a1e37487d18c5034b6ff66e7d4","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing directory edits**\n\nI'm figuring out how to implement the directory edit function alongside a shared matcher for replacement. It seems that routes like GET /directory and /directory/due-range need to retain any invalid applications that are applied. I want to make sure it has a clean look, so using plain notes with white-space pre-wrap is essential. I'll keep this in mind as I work through the details to ensure everything functions smoothly!"}

